-- The teachers' general agreements' root (MMS-518): the agreements of the
-- corpus's agreements/teachers-general family that speak to an item of the
-- shared vocabulary (l4/lib/vocabulary.l4), each registered once as an
-- instrument (it describes itself in its own file), and what each claims
-- for a case. The agreements' root (l4/lib/agreements-root.l4) imports it
-- beside the other families' roots, and rules among its agreements by the
-- rule of this file first and §23 after; precedence between collections is
-- left to l4/lib/precedence.l4.
--
-- THE FAMILY'S OWN RULE is about amendments. The agreement of 21.2.2008
-- gives the 2008 supplement; the agreement of 17.6.2009 puts its third
-- step off ("במקום משכורת חודש דצמבר 2009 יבוא משכורת חודש אוקטובר 2011"),
-- and the agreement of 24.11.2010 brings it forward again ("כפי שתוקן
-- בהסכם הקיבוצי מיום 17.6.09, במקום משכורת חודש אוקטובר 2011 יבוא משכורת
-- חודש נובמבר 2010"). Each amendment's
-- claim is the earlier agreement as it amends it, so the three are not
-- three agreements that apply side by side, for §23 to weigh: the earlier
-- words were changed lawfully, and a personal provision is part of the
-- contract only while it is not (the Collective Agreements Law, §19). In a
-- salary month the latest amendment in force speaks for the chain, and the
-- agreement it amends does not compete with it (convention
-- instruments.amendment-chain, put to the lawyer).
--
-- A teacher paid by the Ofek Hadash tables is in none of their claims: the
-- base agreement's §44(ב)(1) took the 2001 and 2008 supplements into the
-- salary it converts, and §47 converts it again at the 21.2.2008
-- agreement's dates (convention instruments.converted-supplements).

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT precedence
IMPORT collective_agreements_law
IMPORT `2001-12-18_histadrut-hamorim_wage-agreement-1999-2001`
IMPORT `2008-02-21_teachers_tosefet-2008_wage-supplement`
IMPORT `2009-06-17_teachers_wage-update-deferral`
IMPORT `2010-11-24_teachers_wage-update-advancement`

§ `שורש ההסכמים הכלליים לעובדי הוראה — מה ההסכמים אומרים על כל פריט`

§§ `המסמכים`

-- This root includes the teachers' general agreements:
`the teachers' general agreements' instruments` MEANS
    LIST `the agreement of 18.12.2001`, `the agreement of 21.2.2008`, `the agreement of 17.6.2009`,
         `the agreement of 24.11.2010`

§§ `שרשרת התיקונים`

-- The agreement of 21.2.2008 and the agreements that amend it, in the
-- order they were made: each amends the one before in its own words — the
-- deferral §4(א)(3) of 21.2.2008 (its §3(א)(1)), the advancement §4(א)(3)
-- "as amended" by the deferral (its §3(א)(1)).
`the agreement of 21.2.2008 and its amendments` MEANS
    LIST `the agreement of 21.2.2008`, `the agreement of 17.6.2009`, `the agreement of 24.11.2010`

`the amendment chains` MEANS LIST `the agreement of 21.2.2008 and its amendments`

-- An amending agreement speaks of the salary months from the one it was
-- signed in: neither amendment sets itself another start that the corpus
-- dates (convention instruments.amendment-chain; the deferral's §4 waits on
-- the havraa statute, a day outside the corpus, and before December 2009
-- it changes no month of the agreement it amends).
GIVEN i IS AN `instrument`, c IS A `teaching case`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the amendment is in force in the salary month of` i c IF
    `the salary month is at least` c (DATE_YEAR (i's `issued`)) (DATE_MONTH (i's `issued`))

-- The agreements a chain's agreement is amended by, after it in the chain.
GIVEN m IS A STRING
      chain IS A LIST OF `instrument`
GIVETH A LIST OF `instrument`
DECIDE `the amendments after` m chain IS
    drop 1 (dropWhile (GIVEN i YIELD NOT i's `module` EQUALS m) chain)

-- Whether an amendment in force in the salary month changed the provision
-- a claim rests on: a later agreement of its chain is in force.
GIVEN x IS A `claim`, c IS A `teaching case`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a later amendment in force changed` x c IF
    any (GIVEN chain YIELD any (GIVEN a YIELD `the amendment is in force in the salary month of` a c)
                               (`the amendments after` (x's `by`'s `module`) chain))
        `the amendment chains`

-- The provision a claim rests on, as §19 asks of it: a pay term of an
-- agreement that applies to the teacher and his employer (the claim's own
-- file decides that), changed lawfully where a later amendment is in force.
GIVEN x IS A `claim`, c IS A `teaching case`
GIVETH AN `agreement provision`
DECIDE `the provision the claim rests on` x c IS
    `agreement provision` WITH
        `is about terms of work, the end of work, or a duty or right of the employee and employer` IS TRUE
        `the agreement applies to the employer and the employee` IS TRUE
        `changed or cancelled lawfully` IS `a later amendment in force changed` x c

-- §19: what is left are the claims whose provision is still part of the
-- teacher's contract of employment — of a chain, its latest amendment in
-- force. These, and no others, are what §23 weighs.
GIVEN claims IS A LIST OF `claim`
      c IS A `teaching case`
GIVETH A LIST OF `claim`
DECIDE `the claims §19 leaves in force` claims c IS
    filter (GIVEN x YIELD `is part of the employee's contract of employment` (`the provision the claim rests on` x c)) claims

§§ `מה ההסכמים אומרים, לפי פריט`

-- An amendment says nothing of a salary month before the one it was signed
-- in; the agreement it amends speaks of that month alone.
GIVEN i IS AN `instrument`, a IS A MAYBE NUMBER, c IS A `teaching case`
GIVETH A MAYBE `claim`
DECIDE `the claim of the amendment` i a c IS
    IF `the amendment is in force in the salary month of` i c THEN `the claim of` i a ELSE NOTHING

GIVEN i IS A `pay item`, c IS A `teaching case`
GIVETH A LIST OF `claim`
DECIDE `the teachers' general agreements' claims on` i c IS
    CONSIDER i
    WHEN `the 2008 public-sector supplement` THEN
        catMaybes (LIST `the claim of` `the agreement of 21.2.2008` (`the 2008 supplement according to the agreement of 21.2.2008` c),
                        `the claim of the amendment` `the agreement of 17.6.2009`
                            (`the 2008 supplement according to the agreement of 21.2.2008 as amended on 17.6.2009` c) c,
                        `the claim of the amendment` `the agreement of 24.11.2010`
                            (`the 2008 supplement according to the agreement of 21.2.2008 as amended on 24.11.2010` c) c)
    WHEN `the 3% supplement of 2001` THEN
        catMaybes (LIST `the claim of` `the agreement of 18.12.2001` (`the 3% supplement according to the agreement of 18.12.2001` c))
    OTHERWISE EMPTY

-- What each says, less what an amendment in force changed: the claims the
-- family's ruling weighs.
GIVEN i IS A `pay item`, c IS A `teaching case`
GIVETH A LIST OF `claim`
DECIDE `the teachers' general agreements' claims in force on` i c IS
    `the claims §19 leaves in force` (`the teachers' general agreements' claims on` i c) c
